fitness_functions:
  - unchanged: T1 adds LangChain4j OpenAI provider wiring only inside `modules/adapters/src/main/java/com/dreamthought/saaa/adapters/langchain4j`; the boundary fitness function remains the guard that provider imports do not leak into `modules/domain` or `modules/deterministic`
  - added: `hard_gate_non_empty_realization` in `PhenotypeFitnessScorer` fails promotion closed when the realization changed no file; enforced by test rather than by the boundary script, like the `CommandCheckRunner` containment rule
  - unchanged: `check-architecture-boundaries` still fails loudly when a scanned layer directory is missing, and `modules/domain` and `modules/deterministic` still import only `java.*` and repository packages
  - added: `DiffLineBudgetMutationValidator` rejects proposal diffs over `maxLinesChanged` before candidate worktree creation; covered by CLI ATDD and deterministic unit tests
  - unchanged: no layer boundary moved; provider capture stays in `modules/adapters/langchain4j`, candidate TOON writing stays in `modules/adapters/git`, and deterministic/domain code sees only provider-neutral records and ports

